        "notes": "Position ramp 0 -> closing angle on the left finger over 1 s (prescribed, kinematic); the right finger follows through the ideal transmission. Ideal transmission: q_right = ratio x q_left (ratio -1: mirror motion). The coupling is massless, rigid, lossless, without backlash and without friction; the right finger is driven by the constraint, not by a second motor. The motor effort reported on the left joint includes the effort that the constraint transmits to the right finger. The actuator effort is the inverse-dynamics effort (no motor model).",
        "print_settings": {},
